<title>USA: NetSource postpones 3.5 mln shr IPO.</title>
<headline>NetSource postpones 3.5 mln shr IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>NetSource Communications Inc's 3.5 million share initial public offering has been postponed due to market conditions, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The issue was expected to price in a range of $13-$15.</p>
<p>NetSource is based in San Francisco and develops, implements and manages a wide range of communications solutions for business and end-user customers worldwide.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
